    "repo": "https://github.com/RebeccaCeccatelli/music_EBT",
    "disclaimer": "These are selected examples. All clips come from the final evaluation runs: frozen final checkpoints, the same 16 REMI validation prompts for every model, 64-token prompt, 256 generated tokens, temperature 0.7, top-p 0.9. Within each example, every system gets the same prompt and its first sample (no per-model cherry-picking). The aggregate results are in the thesis."
